   248	    Only the directory anchors + flags are SET; the per-file path overrides are
   249	    CLEARED by the caller (see ``AUDIT_CLEAR_CARRIERS``) so they default off
   250	    ``CEO_AUDIT_LOG_DIR``. Single source of truth for both the WS-A session
   251	    redirect (``sync_mode=False``) and the WS-C subprocess-env builder
   252	    (``sync_mode=True`` per S168 — a spawned child must write synchronously for
   253	    the parent to read deterministically).
