    63	
    64	**Upgrading from v1.3.0 with an ACTIVE plan? Read this first.** Since
    65	v1.4.0 the audit log AND the plan state stores (scratchpad SQLite files
    66	for inter-agent handoffs; `/resume` never reads them) resolve per project through
    67	`.claude/hooks/_lib/runtime_paths.py`, not through the legacy
    68	`$HOME/.claude/projects/ceo-orchestration/` directory. Nothing is
    69	migrated: after the upgrade a repository with a plan in flight opens a
    70	NEW, empty state store, and the old files stay on disk. Before you run
    71	the first session on the new version, pick one route:
    72	
    73	- keep reading the legacy store until the plan closes by exporting
    74	  `CEO_PROJECT_NAME=ceo-orchestration` (the documented escape hatch in
