    60	
    61	This snapshots audit log + memory + agent-metrics so you can
    62	recover if the upgrade misbehaves.
    63	
    64	**Upgrading from v1.3.0 with an ACTIVE plan? Read this first.** Since
    65	v1.4.0 the audit log AND the plan state stores (scratchpad SQLite files
