    69	migrated: after the upgrade a repository with a plan in flight opens a
    70	NEW, empty state store, and the old files stay on disk. Before you run
    71	the first session on the new version, pick one route:
    72	
    73	- keep reading the legacy store until the plan closes by exporting
    74	  `CEO_PROJECT_NAME=ceo-orchestration` (the documented escape hatch in
    75	  `state_store.py`; it re-creates the basename-collision hazard, so drop
    76	  it as soon as the plan is done). It moves ONLY the state stores, the
