     2	# CI smoke workflow for PLAN-070 MCP introspection (Phase 3).
     3	#
     4	# === SUPPLY-CHAIN TRUST BOUNDARY (P2-11 closure, 2026-05-04+) ===
     5	#
     6	# This workflow consumes 3 classes of external artifacts. Each is hash-
     7	# pinned at a defense-in-depth level:
     8	#
     9	#   1. GitHub Actions (`uses: ...`):
    10	#      - actions/checkout@<40-char-SHA>  # v6.0.2 (verified)
    11	#      - actions/setup-python@<40-char-SHA>  # v6.2.0 (verified)
    12	#      All other action invocations are FORBIDDEN. ADR-094 (re-affirmed
    13	#      Sprint 32) restricts the trusted-deps set to checkout +
    14	#      setup-python only. Any new action requires an ADR amendment.
    15	#
    16	#   2. Tarball downloads (curl):
    17	#      - actionlint v1.7.7 from GitHub releases. NOT hash-verified at
    18	#        wire because: (a) HTTPS pin to releases.github.com root CA;
    19	#        (b) version pinned in URL; (c) actionlint output gates the
    20	#        workflow itself so a tampered binary would manifest as broken
    21	#        lint. Tracked as residual; closing requires sha256 manifest
    22	#        which actionlint upstream does not currently publish.
    23	#
    24	#   3. PyPI installs (pip):
    25	#      - pip version-bracketed (>=24.0,<26.0) — protects against
    26	#        regressions in pip's own resolver behavior.
    27	#      - ruff==0.7.1 with --no-deps + --no-cache-dir. ruff is a Rust
    28	#        binary distributed as a pre-built wheel; no Python
    29	#        dependencies; --no-cache-dir prevents CI cache poisoning.
    30	#        Full --require-hashes is the next layer (deferred per PLAN-076
    31	#        Item #5 — mechanical gate: re-trigger when CI matrix adds a
    32	#        second platform; requires generated requirements-<wf>.txt).
    33	#
    34	# Per PLAN-070 §6.4 + Round 3 DevOps lens:
    35	#   - Trigger: [push, pull_request] (NOT pull_request_target — fork-PR
    36	#     bypass risk).
    37	#   - Fork-PR guard: skip job if PR head repo != target repo.
    38	#   - Daily cron 0 11 * * * (avoid 09 UTC otel-smoke.yml collision).
    39	#   - SHA-pin all actions (40-char hex; mirrors benchmarks.yml +
    40	#     adapter-live.yml + chaos.yml + coverage.yml baseline).
    41	#   - permissions: contents: read ONLY — NO id-token, NO actions,
    42	#     NO packages, NO OIDC. (Attack surface expansion declined per
    43	#     ADR-094 trusted-deps re-affirm.)
    44	#   - timeout-minutes: 10
    45	#   - Cold-start mitigation: warm-cache step + retry-once on
    46	#     transport-class failure (NEVER on assert failure).
    47	#
    48	# Paths-filter scope: only run when MCP-related code or staging
    49	# changes (PLAN-070 §6.4).
