     6	Purpose
     7	-------
     8	Intercepts when cumulative token spend on a plan exceeds the pre-task
     9	estimate produced by sub-agent 0.2's `token-estimator.py`. Designed to be
    10	called from `/ceo-boot`, a future PreToolUse hook, or directly by the CEO
    11	between waves.
    12	
    13	Two CLI modes
    14	-------------
    15	1. ``check --plan-id PLAN-NNN [--threshold 0.80] [--json]``
    16	   - Read audit-log.jsonl entries scoped to ``plan_id``, sum tokens, compare
    17	     against the estimate file ``<plan-id>.tokens.estimate`` (sibling of the
    18	     plan markdown OR co-located in staging). Exit code 0 if ratio <
    19	     threshold, 1 if ratio >= threshold (caller pauses).
    20	   - First over-threshold detection within the dedup window emits a
    21	     ``token_budget_guard_paused`` audit action; subsequent retries within
    22	     the same window are silent (suppress duplicate emits).
    23	
    24	2. ``auto-pause-hook --plan-id PLAN-NNN [--threshold 0.80]``
    25	   - Designed to be invoked by `/ceo-boot` or a future hook. Outputs a JSON
    26	     object on stdout: ``{"decision": "pause"|"continue", "reason": <str>,
    27	     "plan_id": ..., "estimate_tokens": ..., "actual_tokens": ..., "ratio": ...}``.
    28	   - Always exit 0 (callers parse JSON; HookSpec contract requires fail-open).
